Test Case Type:
Aggregator On-Us Eligibility Reconciliation

Test Case Long Description:
Validate that Aggregator On-Us Eligibility Checks reconcile to the sum of Accepted, Referred and Declined On-Us outcomes for each application decision date.

Expected Results:
Aggregator On-Us Eligibility Checks should equal:
On-Us Accepted
+ On-Us Referred
+ On-Us Declined.

There should be zero difference between the total Aggregator On-Us Eligibility volume and the sum of its outcome buckets.

